REM PLEASE NOTE
REM This script is work in progress. Effect cycling does not yet fully work.

REM Effect Preset Cycle Demo
REM Cycles through all available CRT effect presets,
REM displaying each one for 3 seconds.

LOG "Starting effect preset cycle demo"

REM Start with no effects
LOG "Applying effect: Default"
EFFECT "Default"
WAIT 2s

REM Classic CRT with scanlines and bloom
LOG "Applying effect: Classic CRT"
EFFECT "Classic CRT"
WAIT 2s

REM Amber monitor look
LOG "Applying effect: Amber Monitor"
EFFECT "Amber Monitor"
WAIT 2s

REM Green phosphor monitor
LOG "Applying effect: Green Monitor"
EFFECT "Green Monitor"
WAIT 2s

REM Sharp pixelated look
LOG "Applying effect: Sharp Pixels"
EFFECT "Sharp Pixels"
WAIT 2s

REM Strong phosphor glow effect
LOG "Applying effect: Phosphor Glow"
EFFECT "Phosphor Glow"
WAIT 2s

REM Vintage TV with heavy effects
LOG "Applying effect: Vintage TV"
EFFECT "Vintage TV"
WAIT 2s

REM Arcade cabinet look
LOG "Applying effect: Arcade Cabinet"
EFFECT "Arcade Cabinet"
WAIT 2s

REM Return to default
LOG "Applying effect: Default"
EFFECT "Default"

LOG "Effect preset cycle demo completed"
STOP
